                "Safety plan — a concrete, situation-specific preparation for reducing danger and reaching appropriate help; it may require trained guidance.",
                "Competence — the knowledge, training, authority, and scope needed to help with a particular kind of difficulty.",
                "Interdependence — human dependence upon God and one another within relationships of mutual gift and responsibility, distinct from both isolation and controlling dependence.",
